    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Buckley Real Estate are delighted to present 38 Grosvenor Court to the market, a substantial four-bedroom detached family home located in the highly sought after Dublin 6W area. A great opportunity is on offer to those seeking a character filled family home in a perfect location with multiple local amenities nearby. Its location on Grosvenor Court leaves it a short distance from Templeogue Village while also enjoying quiet and peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nGrosvenor Court is located within easy access to Terenure, Templeogue, Perrystown and Walkinstown, there is no shortage of amenities on offer to prospective buyers here. Whilst being close to the heart of the city center, the area maintains its quite residential atmosphere. Both Bushy Park, Templeogue and Terenure Villages alike with their vast array of shops, bars and restaurants are both within a 20 minute walk from your front door. Exceptional family pubs such as The Pines and The Laurels are also only a short stroll away.  There are numerous primary and secondary schools within walking distance, including Terenure college, Templeogue College, St Pius X, St Josephs, Presentation and Our Lady's. The M50 is also only a short distance away making travel to and from Dublin all the easier, while Dublin Airport is only 30 minutes away. \r\n\r\nBetween size, location and condition, we expect this to be a popular listing. Early viewing is advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Upon entering the property you will be greeted by a long entrance hallway stunningly fitted with laminated wooden floors which are also seen throughout the downstairs of the home. Adjacent to the hallway sees a downstairs guest bathroom, There is a large living room come dining room with entrance to the kitchen in the rear of the property joined by a large rear garage to the side. The first of the properties four bedrooms is situated downstairs, fitted with a shower and sink basin. The upstairs features three double bedrooms, including one master bedroom with an en-suite. The property is finished with a paved rear garden, along with a large front driveway with space for off street parking for up to three cars."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 bed, 3 bathroom semi detached family home\r\nGreat location\r\nPeaceful, residential estate\r\nClose proximity to M50\r\nWell serviced public transport area\r\nDublin Airport within a 40 minute drive."
      },
